1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,786
The first law says energy is conserved.

2
00:00:02,786 --> 00:00:05,299
But it does not tell us which way a change will go.

3
00:00:05,299 --> 00:00:11,679
Energy would be conserved just as well if heat flowed from a cold body into a hot one.

4
00:00:11,679 --> 00:00:12,942
It never does.

5
00:00:12,942 --> 00:00:15,807
The second law supplies the direction.

